{
  "faq": [
    {
      "a": "Hulhumalé Marina, ten minutes from Velana International Airport. We can also collect from most resorts and guesthouses in North and South Malé Atoll by arrangement.",
      "q": "Where does the vessel depart from?",
      "id": "where-does-the-vessel"
    },
    {
      "a": "Twelve for a day charter, four overnight in two en-suite cabins. Twelve is the legal maximum for the vessel and we do not exceed it.",
      "q": "How many guests can you take?",
      "id": "how-many-guests-can"
    },
    {
      "a": "Private use of the vessel, captain and crew, fuel within the itinerary, harbour dues, snorkelling equipment, water and soft drinks. Meals are included where the itinerary says so.",
      "q": "What is included in the rate?",
      "id": "what-is-included-in"
    },
    {
      "a": "The captain decides on the morning. If we cannot sail safely you may move the booking to another date or take a full refund.",
      "q": "What happens if the weather turns?",
      "id": "what-happens-if-the"
    },
    {
      "a": "Yes. Tell us when you enquire — halal is standard, and vegetarian, vegan and allergy-safe menus are prepared on request.",
      "q": "Can you cater for dietary requirements?",
      "id": "can-you-cater-for"
    },
    {
      "a": "A fifty percent deposit confirms the booking; the balance is due seven days before departure. Bank transfer and card are both accepted.",
      "q": "How do we hold a date?",
      "id": "how-do-we-hold"
    }
  ],
